<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Communication Centre — PulseReach</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=9"></head><body class="app"><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark">♥</span> PulseReach</a><div class="org"><small>ORGANIZER</small><b><%= organizer.name %></b><span><%= organizer.organization %></span></div><nav class="side-nav"><a href="/dashboard">Overview</a><a href="/dashboard">Drives</a><a href="/participants">Participants</a><a class="active" href="/communications">Communication</a></nav><div class="side-bottom"><form method="post" action="/logout"><button class="side-logout">Sign out</button></form></div></aside><main class="main"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNICATION ENGINE</div><h1>Personalised communication</h1><p>Generate consent-aware messages using language, confirmation, response behaviour and time remaining.</p></div></div><div class="notice"><b>How it works</b><p>Gemini is optional. If <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code> is configured, PulseReach asks Gemini to generate a short personalised message. Without a key, the system uses a safe local template fallback. No messages are actually sent in this prototype.</p></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Generate for a drive</h2><p>Only participants who have current-drive communication consent are included.</p></div></div><div class="drive-list"><% if (!drives.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No drives yet.</b><p>Create a drive before generating communication.</p></div><% } %><% drives.forEach(d => { %><div class="communication-drive"><div><b><%= d.name %></b><small><%= d.venue %> · <%= new Date(d.date).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></small></div><form method="post" action="/communications/preview-drive/<%= d._id %>"><button class="btn btn-primary">Generate previews</button></form></div><% }) %></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Recent generated previews</h2><p>Every preview records the language, stage, consent check and generation source.</p></div></div><div class="message-list"><% if (!logs.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No messages generated yet.</b><p>Generate a preview for a participant or drive to see it here.</p></div><% } %><% logs.forEach(log => { %><article class="message-card"><div class="message-meta"><span class="status"><%= log.generatedBy %></span><span><%= log.stage %></span><span><%= log.language %></span><span><%= new Date(log.createdAt).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></span></div><p><%= log.message %></p><small><%= log.participantId?.name || 'Participant' %> · <%= log.driveId?.name || 'Drive' %></small></article><% }) %></div></section></main></body></html>
